# Aqib Shah Tailoring Manager

This project is a C# WPF desktop application for a tailoring and clothing business. It was created as a modern Windows desktop version of the original Python desktop app, with a strong dark-gold design and management dashboard.

## Features
- Customer management
- Order management
- Payment tracking
- Dashboard overview
- SQLite database storage
- Export / import backup support
- Modern WPF UI with premium styling

## Run the project

### Requirements
- Windows 10/11
- .NET 8 SDK
- Visual Studio 2022 or later

### Commands
```bash
dotnet restore
dotnet build
dotnet run
```

## Project structure
- `TailorShop.csproj` — project configuration
- `App.xaml` — theme resources
- `MainWindow.xaml` — dashboard and management screens
- `Models.cs` — customer, order, and payment models
- `DatabaseService.cs` — SQLite database logic

## Database location
The app stores its SQLite file in the user's Documents folder:

```text
%USERPROFILE%\Documents\AqibShahTailor.db
```

## Notes
This is a completed design-first WPF conversion ready for further extension with measurements, styles, and receipt printing for the full business workflow.
